commit 9b3ecd990270ac22d77a198eb96e782f04cec4ed
Author: Scott Sunarto <github@smsunarto.com>
Date:   Mon Nov 16 13:01:01 2026 -0800

    fix(slopcop): keep rule titles inside their cards on narrow panels
    
    The rule title was a centered, nowrap shadcn Button given min-w-0 (since
    0e072f372), so on narrow panels it shrank below its text and the text
    spilled out both sides, over the repository chip. The title now truncates
    with its full name in a tooltip, and the repository and mode chips wrap to
    their own line. The header's account label truncates and moves under the
    tabs on a narrow panel. Activity comment rows give the path and excerpt
    their own lines below 480px instead of pushing them off-screen.

